WEBVTT

00:00:09.920 --> 00:00:13.640
Negative
You Don’t Love Me

00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:32.760
Now I understand it all

00:00:33.720 --> 00:00:37.840
When I take a closer look,
when I pull back the curtains

00:00:38.320 --> 00:00:41.760
And see you beside her

00:00:42.360 --> 00:00:46.400
I just have this overwhelming urge
To smash your head in

00:00:46.524 --> 00:00:47.217
Because

00:00:47.313 --> 00:00:49.196
You don’t love me

00:00:49.320 --> 00:00:51.560
You don’t love me

00:00:51.600 --> 00:00:53.600
You don’t love me

00:00:53.760 --> 00:00:55.760
What does she have that I don’t?

00:00:55.920 --> 00:00:57.920
You don’t love me

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:00.000
You don’t love me

00:01:00.200 --> 00:01:02.440
You don’t love me

00:01:06.480 --> 00:01:09.440
I won’t forget

00:01:10.640 --> 00:01:14.280
How many times you forgot about me

00:01:14.760 --> 00:01:18.720
And I know it’s too late

00:01:19.120 --> 00:01:23.240
For our ugly story to
become a beautiful fairy tale

00:01:23.317 --> 00:01:23.777
Because

